<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The Statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies(Indian Accounting Standards) Rules,2015 (Ind AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognised accounting practices to the extent applicable.      2. The above results have been reviewed by Audit committee and approved by Board of Directors of the Company at their meetings held on October 24,2024. The results are subjected to Limited Review by the auditors of the Company in terms of Regulation 33 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (LODR).      3. Other Income in standalone financial results includes dividend income from subsidiaries as below:   dividend income from subsidiary of INR 35.44 Million for Quarter ended 30th September, 2024, INR 35.54 million for Quarter ended June 30, 2024, INR 26.96 Mio for Quarter ended Sept 30, 2023, INR 995.12 million for Nine months ended 30th Sept 24, INR 988.49 Mio for Nine months ended 30th Sept 2023 and for INR 1097.93 million Year ended December 31, 2023.      4. The Company has changed its name from Mahindra CIE Automotive Limited to CIE Automotive India Limited during the previous year ended December 31, 2023.      5. The Board of Directors of the Company at their meeting held on February 19, 2024 recommended final dividend of Rs.5.00 per equity share of Rs.10 each fully paid up for financial year 2023 which has been paid during quarter ended June 30, 2024.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
